sentences.text:
While on bail, the petitioner will abide by the following terms and conditions: -
(I) The petitioner will not intimidate the witnesses, nor will he influence any evidence in any manner whatsoever;
Reserved On: 03.01.2025 vs State Of Himachal Pradesh on 10 January, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/91187918/
4 (II) The petitioner shall attend the trial in case a charge sheet is presented against him and will not seek unnecessary adjournments;
(III) The petitioner will not leave the present address for a continuous period of seven days without furnishing the address of intending visit to the SHO, the Police Station concerned and the Trial Court;

